top_neighbors.body_raw:
@ACTION_CLASS mapping:
  {activity: MODIFY_CANDIDATE, effect: CANDIDATE_WRITE, risk: LOW} → within @EXECUTION_ENVELOPE — pre-approved.
  {activity: MODIFY_PROJECT, effect: PERSISTENT_WRITE, risk: ELEVATED} → requires @G4 explicit approval.
  {activity: PROMOTE_STABLE, effect: PERSISTENT_WRITE, risk: CRITICAL} → ALWAYS explicit user approval.
  {activity: SELF_MODIFY, effect: PERSISTENT_WRITE, risk: CRITICAL} → triple-separation enforced.
  {activity: EXECUTE_TEST, effect: NO_WRITE, risk: LOW}
  {activity: OBSERVE, effect: NO_WRITE, risk: LOW}

Goal: Advance a claim from Guess → Hypothetical → Inferred → Exact.

Step 1 (Guess→Hypothetical): code/web search confirms claim exists. Gate: @G1.
Step 2 (Hypothetical→Inferred): ALL deps in G (Exact|Inferred), DAG acyclic. Gate: @G8 — inference_stamp.
Step 3 (Inferred→Exact): oracle PASS on declared scope. Gate: @G8 — oracle_stamp.

Stamps:
  @STAMPS.oracle_stamp → σ(c)=Exact
  @STAMPS.inference_stamp → σ(c)=Inferred
  @STAMPS.direct_evidence_stamp → σ(c)=Exact

Diagram: @CLAIM_PROMOTION_DIAGRAM.

